{"title": "Sponge Tray", "pageid": 27347, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Sponge_Tray", "categories": ["Misc items", "Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Sponge_Tray_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/34/Sponge_Tray_Faded.png/300px-Sponge_Tray_Faded.png.webp, /w/images/3/34/Sponge_Tray_Faded.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Sponge Tray image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/34/Sponge_Tray_Faded.png/300px-Sponge_Tray_Faded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/34/Sponge_Tray_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p>Sponge Tray is a <a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\">Miscellaneous</a> item. Using this will clean off dirt, blood, and face-paint, and you will remove conditions that make you smell.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; 